NAVAGRAHA (THE 9 PLANETS):
- Perform a complete analysis of all 9 Planets: Surya (Sun), Chandra (Moon), Mangal (Mars), Budha (Mercury), Guru (Jupiter), Shukra (Venus), Shani (Saturn), Rahu, and Ketu. Identify which of these 9 are fueling the 9-5-1 willpower line currently.

PHYSICAL ARTIFACTS:
${visuals?.face ? "- Face Analysis: Present. Focus on the 12 Houses of the Face." : "- Face: Not provided."}
${visuals?.leftHand ? "- Left Palm: Present." : "- Left Palm: Not provided."}
${visuals?.rightHand ? "- Right Palm: Present." : "- Right Palm: Not provided."}

KARMIC TIMELINE (${lifeEvents.length} Anchors):
